<div class="markdown-body"><p><em>em</em> and <em>em</em>, <strong>strong</strong> and <strong>strong</strong>, <strong><em>both</em></strong> and <strong><em>both</em></strong>.</p><p><strong>bold <em>and italic</em> inside</strong> and <em>italic </em><strong><em>and bold</em></strong><em> inside</em>.</p><p>A <a href="https://example.com"><strong>strong link</strong></a> and <em><code>code</code> in em</em>.</p></div>